Bind void to add-pair, given (the series of record like (the text label, the number size) bag):
    Insert (a record with (the label ("a" joined to "b"), the size 2)) into bag.
Done.
Define pairs as a series of record like (the text label, the number size).
Pull a rabbit.
    Cast add-pair on (pairs).
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State the label of item 1 of pairs.
